      "message": "If the file does not exist, the expected Redfish response is 404 Not Found. Returning a success message for a missing file appears to be incorrect.",
      "revId": "370bc14dfef654d26b4e38c667110e6d55fc9e62",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
